### Get all schedules
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules

###

### Get example schedule format
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/info/example

###

### Create a weekday work hours schedule
POST http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekday Work Hours",
  "description": "Customized recording during work hours Monday-Friday",
  "days": ["monday", "tuesday", "wednesday", "thursday", "friday"],
  "timeRanges": [
    { "start": "06:00", "end": "10:00" },
    { "start": "12:00", "end": "14:00" },
    { "start": "20:00", "end": "23:59" }
  ],
  "mode": 2,
  "allOtherMotions": true,
  "cameras": [],
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Create a weekend battery saving schedule
POST http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend Battery Saving",
  "description": "Save battery all day on weekends",
  "days": ["saturday", "sunday"],
  "timeRanges": [
    { "start": "00:00", "end": "23:59" }
  ],
  "mode": 0,
  "allOtherMotions": false,
  "cameras": [],
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Create a nighttime schedule for specific camera
POST http://localhost:3000/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Backyard Night Mode",
  "description": "Enhanced recording for backyard camera at night",
  "days": ["monday", "tuesday", "wednesday", "thursday", "friday", "saturday", "sunday"],
  "timeRanges": [
    { "start": "22:00", "end": "06:00" }
  ],
  "mode": 2,
  "allOtherMotions": true,
  "cameras": ["T8113N63212153EF"],
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Update a schedule (replace SCHEDULE_ID with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/SCHEDULE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Schedule Name",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Toggle schedule enable/disable (replace SCHEDULE_ID with actual ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/SCHEDULE_ID/toggle

###

### Get specific schedule (replace SCHEDULE_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/SCHEDULE_ID

###

### Delete a schedule (replace SCHEDULE_ID with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/schedules/SCHEDULE_ID

###
